      "sections": [
        {
          "span": "step-4",
          "text": "When an urgent incident arrives, record its time and customer impact. The on-call engineer acknowledges the page and opens a bridge. Before changing service configuration, identify the affected region and check the change log. If symptoms point to a shared dependency, notify the incident commander. The team then records each action, the observed effect, and the next owner in the incident timeline."
